list_theories — evaluation
===========================

Focal tool: list_theories.
Setup: a server with HOL-Library in its configured catalogue.
Prompt: "List the theory names in HOL-Library and identify the one named Multiset."
Success: the agent selects list_theories with that session and reports the
actual returned name. It does not claim image/load status or source positions,
which this tool does not provide. An unknown session is reported faithfully.
